---
swarmId: "{{.projectId}}-swarm"
displayName: "{{.displayName}} review team"

roles:
  - name: "hunter_a"
    modelTier: "coding"
    description: "Hunts for problems in the masked diff."
    model: "{{.llmModel}}"
    runtime:
      image: "ghcr.io/easeit-cz/vornik-agent:latest"
      envVars:
        VORNIK_MAX_TOOL_ITERATIONS: "30"
    permissions:
      allowedTools: ["current_time", "file_write", "forge_diff_part"]
  - name: "hunter_b"
    modelTier: "complex"
    description: "Hunts independently, on a second model when one is set."
    model: "{{.llmModelAlt}}"
    runtime:
      image: "ghcr.io/easeit-cz/vornik-agent:latest"
      envVars:
        VORNIK_MAX_TOOL_ITERATIONS: "30"
    permissions:
      allowedTools: ["current_time", "file_write", "forge_diff_part"]
  - name: "triager"
    modelTier: "standard"
    description: "Merges and ranks the two hunters' lists."
    model: "{{.llmModel}}"
    runtime:
      image: "ghcr.io/easeit-cz/vornik-agent:latest"
      envVars:
        VORNIK_MAX_TOOL_ITERATIONS: "20"
    permissions:
      allowedTools: ["current_time", "file_write"]
  - name: "adjudicator"
    modelTier: "complex"
    description: "Keeps the findings the diff confirms and writes the verdict."
    model: "{{.llmModel}}"
    runtime:
      image: "ghcr.io/easeit-cz/vornik-agent:latest"
      envVars:
        VORNIK_MAX_TOOL_ITERATIONS: "30"
    permissions:
      allowedTools: ["current_time", "file_write", "forge_diff_part"]
---

# {{.displayName}} review team

Four diff-only roles (GitHub #801): two hunters, a triager and an
adjudicator. None can read the repository's checkout. The hunters and the
adjudicator read a large diff's further parts with forge_diff_part, which
serves only the masked diff (GitHub #814).
